static sprite layout from source (permitted public-game offline dev, same
precedent L7's own solve used) to map the four-distinct-color rack
structure, and confirmed the basic actuator controls live. Structurally
similar to L6/L7's dual-pair puzzle but uses four distinct colors instead
of one shared crossing color, so the prior solution pattern likely
doesn't transfer directly. No win attempted yet -- pure reconnaissance.

